{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"19981","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/19981","key":"MC-274372","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"11/Jul/24 11:34 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>The using_item advancement keeps trigger even when the player isn't holding down right mouse button if the reward function has a command that let the player teleport through dimension, causing the player to be stuck at a position unless they no longer holding the item.</p>\n\n<p>The advancement:</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-json\">{\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"code-quote\">\"criteria\"</span>:\n&nbsp; &nbsp; {\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"code-quote\">\"book\"</span>:\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; {\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"code-quote\">\"trigger\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"minecraft:using_item\"</span>,\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"code-quote\">\"conditions\"</span>:\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; {\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"code-quote\">\"item\"</span>:\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; {\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"code-quote\">\"items\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"minecraft:book\"</span>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }\n&nbsp; &nbsp; },\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"code-quote\">\"rewards\"</span>:\n&nbsp; &nbsp; {\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"code-quote\">\"<span class=\"code-keyword\">function</span>\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"test:book\"</span>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; }\n}\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>The function:</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">advancement revoke @s only test:book\nexecute in overworld run tp @s 0 -60 0 0 0\nplaysound entity.player.teleport\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p><b>What I expected to happen was:</b><br>\nThe advancement stop trigger when release right mouse button.</p>\n\n<p><b>What actually happened was:</b><br>\nThe advancement keeps trigger and execute the reward function none-stop.</p>\n\n<p><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b><br>\n1. Put the following datapack into your world and <tt>/reload</tt> it.<br>\n2. Use the following command to get an edible book.</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/give @s book[food={can_always_eat: <span class=\"code-keyword\">true</span>, eat_seconds: 86400, nutrition: 1, saturation: 1}]\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>3. Go to the nether.<br>\n4. In the nether, start using the book until you appear in the overworld.<br>\n5. You will be teleported back to the overworld, and stuck at (0, -60, 0) until you use the book again or switch to another hotbar slot.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"12/Jul/24 11:32 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/36113","id":"36113","filename":"Bug.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"AC","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Taipei","accountType":"customer"},"created":"11/Jul/24 11:33 PM","size":"6.94 MB","mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/36113"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/36114","id":"36114","filename":"MC-274372.zip","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5ec8dd4db199aa0c1306447c/7698f7c4-2508-4ce5-a207-0b2918018f22/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5ec8dd4db199aa0c1306447c/7698f7c4-2508-4ce5-a207-0b2918018f22/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5ec8dd4db199aa0c1306447c/7698f7c4-2508-4ce5-a207-0b2918018f22/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5ec8dd4db199aa0c1306447c/7698f7c4-2508-4ce5-a207-0b2918018f22/32"},"displayName":"[Mod] ManosSef","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Athens","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"12/Jul/24 4:32 AM","size":"0.7 kB","mimeType":"application/zip","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/36114"}],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"07/Aug/24 1:15 AM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"26/Apr/25 3:55 PM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"using_item advancement trigger keeps being activated even after the item stops being used, after teleporting to another dimension","issuetype":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"A problem which impairs or prevents the functions of the product. (Migrated on 23 Jan 2025 19:08 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium","name":"Bug","subtask":false,"avatarId":10303,"hierarchyLevel":0},"watches":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/MC-274372/watchers","watchCount":1,"is